Tracing:
-------
Goal: Distributed tracing across services and pipelines.
OpenTelemetry propagates a request ID across service boundaries.
Captures latency per hop and errors.
Correlates with logs and metrics in New Relic.

Example:
HTTP request enters ALB → EKS Pod → DB → downstream service.
OTel adds trace ID and span IDs at each hop.
Exported to New Relic for trace visualization.

